#: src/ui/guide.blp:41
msgid "Instances"
msgstr "实例"

#: src/ui/guide.blp:42
msgid ""
"They are the bridge between you and AI models.\n"
"\n"
"Ollama can be used to run AI models locally in your device.\n"
"\n"
"You can modify or create new instances later by accessing the Instance "
"Manager from the main dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
"它们是您与 AI 模型之间的桥梁。\n"
"\n"
"Ollama 可以用来在您的设备上本地运行 AI 模型。\n"
"\n"
"您可以通过主下拉菜单中的实例管理器来修改或创建新的实例。"

#: src/ui/guide.blp:50 src/ui/guide.blp:51
msgid "Create Ollama Instance"
msgstr "创建 Ollama 实例"

#: src/ui/guide.blp:60 src/ui/guide.blp:61
msgid "Connect to External Server"
msgstr "连接到外部服务器"

#: src/ui/guide.blp:76
msgid "Models"
msgstr "模型"

#: src/ui/guide.blp:77
msgid ""
"Choose the right brain for the job. From lightning-fast replies to advanced "
"coding and creative writing, Alpaca has a model tailored for whatever you "
"might need.\n"
"\n"
"You can access the Model Manager later from the main dropdown menu"
msgstr ""
"为工作选择合适的大脑。从快速回复到高级编码和创意写作，Alpaca 都有适合您需求的模型。\n"
"\n"
"您可以稍后从主下拉菜单访问模型管理器。"

#: src/ui/guide.blp:80 src/ui/guide.blp:81
#: src/ui/widgets/models/text_selector.blp:10
msgid "Open Model Manager"
msgstr "打开模型管理器"

#: src/ui/guide.blp:97
msgid "Enjoy Alpaca"
msgstr "享受 Alpaca"

#: src/ui/guide.blp:98
msgid ""
"There are even more features waiting for you, explore the whole interface to "
"find more functionality!"
msgstr ""
"还有更多功能在等着您，探索整个界面以发现更多功能！"

#: src/ui/guide.blp:101 src/ui/guide.blp:102
msgid "Close Guide"
msgstr "关闭指南"

